*** Test Cases ***
CB008533-A-B2a_Blind_SCell_Addition
    [Documentation]
    ...  1.DESCRIPTION
    ...     This user scenario describes the successful operation of Blind SCell Addition where gNB performs SCell selection for 4CC mixed mode CA
    ...     with PCell as FDD in SA mode. Up to 4 NRRELs are configured as CA enabled. In blind mode, SCells are added when UE connects with PCell,
    ...     based on calculated SCell weight factor. CA relations are defined with multiple FDD and TDD cells as SCells.
    ...  2.TEST ENVIRONMENT AND SETTINGS
    ...     This item is testing in UTE environment:
    ...     •	5G Classical SA CMWV L1Bypass cloud test line (CLOUD_5G_I_BOO_AP_KLLL_SANSA_L1B_ECPRI_CMWV_TDD) gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA),
    ...     UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL), WTS 5G core simulator (Egate)
    ...     •	gNB has configured 4CC for Carrier Aggregation: 2 Cell FDD and 2 Cells TDD (CA relations created)
    ...     •	simulated Radio (AHLOA, AHFIB, AEQE, AHCA)
    ...     Used HW: gNB (ASIB, 2xABIO, AMIA), UE simulator (Airphone ASIK + 3xABIL)
    ...     Simulated RRH (AHLOA) – gNB ABIO-1 RF1, AP ABIL-1: Cell-1 – FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n71 )
    ...     Simulated RRH (AHFIB) – gNB ABIO-1 RF2, AP ABIL-2: Cell-1 – FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n66 ), Cell-5 – FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n25 )
    ...     Simulated RRH (AEQE) – gNB ABIO-1 RF7, AP ABIL-3: Cell-2 – TDD FR1 100MHz ( band n41 ), Cell-6 – TDD FR1 100MHz ( band n77 )
    ...     Simulated RRH (AHCA) – gNB ABIO-2 RF1, AP ABIL-1: Cell-3 – FDD FR1 20MHz ( band n5 )
    ...     Both TDD Cells are configured on the same RU so they are mapped to the same L2-RT instance!
    ...  2.1 Testing Tools
    ...     •	gNB: Nokia 5G BTS
    ...     •	Airphone (AP) – UEs simulator
    ...     •	WTS – ePC simulator - 5G core network simulator
    ...     •	Tcpdump & Wireshark – tools for capturing messages
    ...     •	BTSLog (cli) for collecting gNB & AP remote syslog
    ...     •	Robot Framework and Python runtime environment to automate the testing process
    ...     •	Web Element Manager
    ...  2.2 Test Automation
    ...     Automation in robotframework
    ...  3. DEFINITIONS FROM THE TEST SET
    ...     Test case covers: 5G_RAN_USR_RRM_14519
    ...  3.1 Definitions from the Test Plan
    ...  3.2 Required Logs
    ...     •	Wireshark/TCPdump Logs (NGAP, NR-RRC, E1AP, F1AP)
    ...     •	TTI Trace
    ...     •	Counters
    ...     •	Default gNB & AP SysLog
    ...     •	BTS Snapshot
    ...     •	BIP logs
    ...     •	Sherpa Trace
    ...  4. TESTING INSTRUCTIONS
    ...  4.1 Preconditions
    ...     •	gNB is configured with FDD (20MHz) and TDD FR1 (100MHz) cells on one ABIO card
    ...     •	All FDD cells are configured to allow SA access.
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.cellDepType is set to 1 (SA) or 10 (SA+NSA)
    ...     •	CA relations are configured for each FDD cell by 4 NRRELs pointing to:
    ...      o	2 FDD and 2 TDD FR1 cells
    ...     •	Within each NRREL object NRBTS/NRCELL/NRREL.sCellAdditionMethod parameter is set to 0 (blind)
    ...     •	SCell activation method is set to buffer based:
    ...     o	NRBTS.sCellActivationMethod = 1 (bufferBased)
    ...     •	Initial number of SCells to be activated jointly is set:
    ...     o	MRBTS/NRBTS/NRCELL.iniNumSCellsToActivate = 2
    ...     •	DRX is disabled in both FDD and TDD FR1 cells:
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.actCDrx = false
    ...     •	DSS features are disabled in FDD Cells:
    ...     o	NRBTS.actLteNrDss = false
    ...     •	Aperiodic CSI reporting for PCell only is enabled:
    ...     o	NRBTS.NRCELL.actAperCsi = true
    ...     •	TDD cells are configured with subframe configuration according to 5GC001116-B
    ...     o	frameStructureType = tdLte
    ...     o	guardPeriodLength = 6 symbols (SSF6)
    ...     o	lteToNrFrameShift = 0ms
    ...     o	prachConfiguration = 97 (format A2 in subframe 7)
    ...     o	ssBurstSetPeriod = 20ms
    ...     •	TDD cells are configured with beamforming:
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.actBeamforming = true
    ...     •	Beam Refinement is activated on TDD cells:
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.nrBtsBeamRefinementP2 = true
    ...     •	TDD cells are configured without 5GC002200:
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.dlMimoMode <> 70 (8x4 Closed Loop Spatial Multiplexing)
    ...     •	FDM scheduling is enabled:
    ...     o	NRBTS.actFdmScheduling = true
    ...     o	NRBTS/NRCELL.actIncreasedFdmUsersPerSlot = true
    ...     Note: for detailed configuration of FDM see URSCs in CB006667/CB007859
    ...     •	FDD and TDD FR1 cells are configured and on-air
    ...     •	Activate feature CB008533 by:
    ...     o	configuring parameter NRBTS/NRCELL.maxNumSCellsDlFr1 = 3
    ...     •	FDD PCell (Cell 1) belongs to n71
    ...     •	Cell 1 has NRRELs that point to
    ...     o	Cell 2: FDD ( band n66 )
    ...     o	Cell 3: TDD ( band n41 )
    ...     o	Cell 4: FDD ( band n5 )
    ...     o	Cell 6: TDD ( band n77 )
    ...     •	PCell (Cell 1) has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs
    ...     •	PCell (Cell 1) has less than NRCELL-maxNumOfCaUsersNRCell connected UEs with FR1 CA configured
    ...     •	SCells (Cell 2, Cell 3, Cell 4, Cell 6) have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfUsersNRCell connected UEs each
    ...     •	SCells (Cell 2, Cell 3, Cell 4, Cell 6) have less than NRCELL-maxNumOfSCellAlloc DL SCell allocations each
    ...     •	SCell weights (NRBTS/NRCELL.weightForSCellSelection) are configured as below:
    ...     o	Cell 6 (TDD) > Cell 4 (FDD) > Cell 3 (TDD) > Cell 2 (FDD)
    ...     •	Loading (number of UEs) in each SCell is the same
    ...     •	UE supports Inter-band 4CC band combinations –
    ...     o	CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A (FDD + FDD + TDD + TDD)
    ...     o	CA_n71A-n66A-n77A-n41A (FDD + FDD + TDD + TDD)
    ...     o	CA_n41C-n25A-n71A (TDD + TDD + FDD + FDD)
    ...     •	UE has successfully attached to the PCell either via ICS or incoming HO
    ...  4.2 Test Step
    ...     Step-1: Band Combination and SCell Selection for SCell Addition by gNB-CU
    ...     Description:
    ...     1.	4CC capable NR-UE is registered in PCell
    ...     2.	PDU session for NR-UE is established
    ...     Expected:
    ...     •	SCell Addition is triggered on gNB-CU due to non-zero number of NRRELs with scellAdditionMethod configured
    ...     •	gNB-CU selects Cell 4 (FDD), Cell 6(TDD) and Cell 3(TDD) as SCells for 4CC CA, considering SCell weight and load factor
    ...     and gNB-UE band combination matching (CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A with n71(FDD) as PCell) as the best band combination
    ...     •	The gNB-CU proceeds with SCell Addition:
    ...     	The gNB CU includes the Cell 4, Cell 6 and Cell 3 in the SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List within F1AP: UE Context Modification Request.
    ...     	The allowedBC-ListMRDC IE with the selected band combination BandCombinationInfo (band combination index and feature set entry index)
    ...     pointing to CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A is also included in the message.
    ...  4.3 Postconditions
    ...     •	UE is attached to the PCell (Cell 1) and configured with 4CC CA as per band combination CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A with one
    ...     FDD SCell (Cell 4) and two TDD SCells (Cell 6 and Cell 3), after SCell Addition is completed
    ...     [CB008533-B]
    ...     •	The corresponding counters for RAC and SCell Addition are updated accordingly
    ...     	GNB_SCELL_3_ADMI_REQ_SA
    ...     	GNB_SCELL_3_ADMI_SUCC_SA
    ...     	GNB_DU_SCELL_3_ADMI_REQ_SA
    ...     	GNB_DU_SCELL_3_ADMI_SUCC_SA
    ...     	RRC_RECONF_ADD3DLSCELL_ATT_SA
    ...     	RRC_RECONF_ADD3DLSCELL_SUCC_SA
    ...     	UE_PCELL_3_CONF_SCELL_DL_SA
    ...     [End CB008533-B]
    ...  5.REFERENCES
    ...     [1] CFAM for CB008533 - https://gates.nsn-net.net/view/00025e8a#o=0
    ...  6.HISTORY
    ...     v0.1 2021.11.16 Lukasz Gdowski – test case draft
    ...     v0.2 2021.12.17 Lukasz Gdowski – correct cells, correct requirements, correct band combinations.

   [Setup]  Run keywords    Wait for next full PM Interval

    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=2
    Register UE  UE_ID=2  CELL_ID=1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE2 message flow check
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=2  RRC_CHECK=False


    Verify SCell-ToBeSetupMod-List IE whether TDD Cell and FDD Cell were selected to 4CC CA for NR-UE2
    Verify sCellToAddModList IE whether TDD Cells and FDD Cell were added as SCells for NR-UE2
    Verify allowedBC-ListMRDC IE whether CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A band combination was selected to 4CC CA for NR-UE2
    Verify counters for successful 4CC FFTT CA

    Release PDU session   UE_ID=2
    Deregister UE  UE_ID=2

    Change weightForSCellSelection for Cell-2 and Cell-4

    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=2
    Register UE  UE_ID=2  CELL_ID=1
    Establish PDU session for NR-UE2 message flow check
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=2  RRC_CHECK=False


    Verify sCellToAddModList IE whether TDD Cells and FDD Cell with higher weightForSCellSelection were added as SCells for NR-UE2
    Verify allowedBC-ListMRDC IE whether CA_n71A-n5A-n77A-n41A band combination was selected to 4CC CA with higher weight for NR-UE2

    Release PDU session   UE_ID=2
    Deregister UE  UE_ID=2

    Wait for next full PM Interval

    Set pdu param for internal traffic  UE_ID=3
    Register UE  UE_ID=3  CELL_ID=1
    Establish PDU session  UE_ID=3  RRC_CHECK=False

    Verify counters for successful 3CC FTT CA
    Verify counters for successful 4CC FFTT CA not increased

    Release PDU session   UE_ID=3

    Deregister UE  UE_ID=3

    ${pm_counter_file}=    Get Latest Unpacked Full Pm Counters File
    Get counters value and report to rp  counters=${counters}  filepath=${pm_counter_file}  localmoid=NRCELL-1

    Produce Scout Data

    [Teardown]  Deconfigure all
